              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Yowabu yar’ umugabisha w’ingabo zose z’Abisirayeli; Benaya mwene Yehoyada ni we yagabisha Abakereti n’Abapeleti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.20.23",
